      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "The flaw needs an FTP wildcard transfer (CURLOPT_WILDCARDMATCH). The curl tool (curl 8.21.0 src/) never sets CURLOPT_WILDCARDMATCH, and the other libcurl users in the image, git 2.55.0's http helpers, do not either."
